OL,3,AHealey pledges cheaper marmalade and
OL,4,Agherkins in pre-Budget package of
OL,5,A'everyday fixes'
OL,6,
OL,7,FJohn Healey is removing import taxes on
OL,8,Fmarmalade, gherkins and more than 100
OL,9,Fproducts ahead of the Budget in a move
OL,10,Faimed at giving families "breathing
OL,11,Fspace" with the cost of living.
OL,13,FThe move is the latest by the
OL,14,Fgovernment to try to ease cost of
OL,15,Fliving pressures on households.
OL,17,FThe measures also include an end to the
OL,18,Fso-called cliff-edge for those
OL,19,Freceiving carer's allowance payments
OL,20,Fand higher tax-free mileage rates being
OL,21,Fmade permanent.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
